<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha3_224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SHA-3 with a digest length of 224, as defined in [FIPS 202](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/202/final)."@en .
